            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a story about death.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luto is a psychological horror experience where you take on the role of someone unable to leave their home. Every attempt to escape will lead you deeper into the unknown, where nothing is as it seems and everything will test your senses.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What lies behind loss:</strong> feel the void left by the absence of a loved one, where despair grows, fed by anxiety and depression. Day after day...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Between reality and fiction:</strong> delve into an enigmatic place and explore its labyrinthine paths full of secrets. The truth has many faces, and you might not like the one you find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will not let you go:</strong> experience unsettling terror that envelops your senses, with fears lurking around every corner. Darkness does not only dwell in shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Never.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>=</strong></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is a story about death.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luto is a psychological horror experience where you take on the role of someone unable to leave their home. Every attempt to escape will lead you deeper into the unknown, where nothing is as it seems and everything will test your senses.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What lies behind loss:</strong> feel the void left by the absence of a loved one, where despair grows, fed by anxiety and depression. Day after day...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Between reality and fiction:</strong> delve into an enigmatic place and explore its labyrinthine paths full of secrets. The truth has many faces, and you might not like the one you find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will not let you go:</strong> experience unsettling terror that envelops your senses, with fears lurking around every corner. Darkness does not only dwell in shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Never.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>=</strong></p>",
            "short_description": "Luto is a psychological horror experience where you take on the role of someone unable to leave their home. Every attempt to escape will lead you deeper into the unknown, where nothing is as it seems and everything will test your senses.",
            "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, French, German, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Catalan, Italian, Polish, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
            "reviews": "“One of the most harrowing and conceptually rich entries in the genre in years, proving that horror can be as emotionally resonant as it is unsettling.”<br>5/5 – Impulse Gamer<br><br>“Luto stands as one of the most powerful games of the year. It’s transformative,  evocative, and breaks form and conventions around how a game should be  and how it should play, taking the overused trope of horror as an allegory for  mental illness, and making it something truly memorable.”<br>9/10 – Checkpoint Gaming<br><br>“Broken Bird Games' debut is a twisting, experimental horror game that goes places you won't see coming.”<br>8/10 – GameSpot<br>",
